{"summary":"Give your brain a challenge by playing the classic brain game.","description":"This is the ad-free version. Enjoy the classic look and feel of the game as you work to mark the mines without uncovering one.  You use the numbers of a revealed square to tell you how many mines are next to that square.  Using logic, you figure out where the mines are and mark them.  Watch out!  If you make a mistake, a mine will explode!\n\nThe app features a clean interface and the minefield fits to your screen size.\n\nThere are three themes available: Classic, Light, and Dark.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":null,"header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/toPgIRPR8zmlL3wrwDEl8IS6msTYz4hmYh8IkRUZtlUHAS9jRS8VIzQnPhStkg5OygbWyES1GFtIreHsEvGuvXE","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0erLKGk1iOIP52ieWdXW2IkdMI4Rdce899Cb96Sho0UYFBvL8OavnG2ZX7PHuVdzDgI3-yvNynJ4o9cLtril5GU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9lCinDMJW4A0p7RFeJY7hM5Vv00NmNIpyJPxzWtbRFSHZXBQh9woeTcKGOZhnpAKIG6MD8w8lgueQBJvQn7LQw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9lCinDMJW4A0p7RFeJY7hM5Vv00NmNIpyJPxzWtbRFSHZXBQh9woeTcKGOZhnpAKIG6MD8w8lgueQBJvQn7LQw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kj_cvYlIw7--0DaRodaOCczmlx7RO3dtuO9-s6Mcl6UtIxr-WsUhKAXu7OGhG7fGu1fJK-iH6U-WWuXLxZ_adQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bFAdQLbZtkWVYhnOPUm3j2TZr_lmJJfVJigb96gzlqrkNXAAqQImxy_-cP3ssq68Is5yNBiqydHycjudNyGT7Ng","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GqLKunSrrpVOuDjQqvtlUeFX__5ZW_gTfH4CtNTbOsy9CKSLyq0DyCxQgcatfHYvOORjfjFKf5u8R8b-wOrU0w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RN_o7es9krzjZp6ijVzdlgHe7iPHEdOLAEDsz5bVv55jg9RPR70vpmtHCKisiQTKfDgP-W1MBCo1Sn3WFFR11g","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Sdhpxel3zF1p9h_x4zuvw8F4P_2dqZ5xp_hl44iupDYuWuV1HEFI30ICofbpfKpPdyiAYRhoU4WWAg0s5-W3Sw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6du_PFHamsxc1RYlVD0QbBImLNOlGSDfqZuinssUgvX1UCWLNh9L8eBA54y-DJKhj7PXhRZum_8Ov_WfkAA4lQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/R48qwYKXH6fH9X7XNupi1